  :1-s1t2u3
  {:statement
   "Since $Z_S$ is diagonal (tensor product of diagonal matrices $Z$ and $I$), and $L_f$ is diagonal by definition, the off-diagonal elements of $\\sum_S \\hat{f}(S) Z_S$ are zero, matching those of $L_f$.",
   :taint :clean,
   :parent nil,
   :content-hash "e5c10cae8cf2d36d",
   :display-order 7,
   :type :claim,
   :scope #{},
   :justification :algebraic-rewrite,
   :status :verified,
