   :dependencies #{:1-g7h8i9 :1-d4e5f6}},
  :1-qed001
  {:statement
   "Therefore $L_f = \\sum_{S \\subseteq [n]} \\hat{f}(S) Z_S$. The diagonal elements agree by the Fourier expansion, and the off-diagonal elements are zero for both operators. QED.",
